  Class: 25
  Name: Warden
  Description: 'The field crew: the Stoat steers, the Sparrow shoots, the Rhino shields. Three vessels flying as one formation;
    press left or right on the D-pad to sit in another one (the camera goes with you) while the other two are
    flown by their AI. In the Stoat, RT is its sling boost; in the Sparrow, aim and fire its guns on RT; in the
    Rhino, hold LT for the shield and press RT for the ward.'
